<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13690" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκεδάννῡμι</span></b>  or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ύω,</span>
		fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκεδάσω,</span>
		
			contr.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σκεδω̆</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					138
				</span></i>
			 (poet. also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκεδ-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.1360
				</span></i>
			, tm.):—<i>scatter abroad, disperse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλους μὲν ἀπεσκέδασεν βασιλῆας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.309
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὰς μὲν ἀπεσκέδασ᾽ ἄλλυδις ἄλλῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.385
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέδασον δ᾽ ἀπὸ κήδεα θυμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.149
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.μύσος</span> S.l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιπάλων ὕβριν ἀπεσκέδασαν</span> Epigr.
			ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.289
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be scattered,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐκ Τροίης ἀποσκεδασθέντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.91
				</span></i>
			; <i>straggle away from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ στρατοπέδου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.4.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φάλαγγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.4.42
				</span></i>
			: —
				Med.
			, <i>repel and scatter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν τοιόνδε φλύαρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					365e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
